From 0bede01811c1b3f19158d116b36ff7de6713ee18 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 23:20:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Month cards tab

One card per month: salary, expenses, savings set aside from salary,
savings objective and an editable "master debts" figure and title.
Expenses can be ticked as paid, given a due date, and split into
sub-expenses with their own checkboxes (yellow while partly paid,
green when fully paid). Cards start collapsed and expand on click.
A chart compares salary and expenses across months.

Stored in a new month_plans table (supabase/migration-013-month-plans.sql)
with row-level security, saved with a short debounce. Translated in
English, French and Arabic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
